      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/8468a699/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-05/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-accession-aftermath/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-05/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-accession-aftermath/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "e3a21f0a5edb16fbc7da8bf4d588103e4ac7b1a5ad5b8202610eb03734096710",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "闵帝性仁厚，于兄弟敦睦，虽遭秦王忌疾，闵帝坦怀待之，卒免于患。及嗣位，于潞王亦无嫌，而硃弘昭、孟汉琼之徒横生猜间，闵帝不能违，以致祸败焉。"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "0672bc44-4b04-589d-9a18-2cf7ea9ba827",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/d4437e45/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-04/sources/library/xinwudaishi-008-congke-eastmarch/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-04/sources/library/xinwudaishi-008-congke-eastmarch/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "b66265792ec4c64669e6e41419da9e98bf4bd7ec2e0f1a193480e3eabf6a162d",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "戊寅，弒鄂王，〈義與「弒濟陰王」同。〉慈州刺史宋令詢死之。"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "0810eee4-2298-5ffb-bab2-b196ec145670",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/1ab64add/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-278/year-0933/part-07/sources/library/jiuwudaishi-066-song-lingxun/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-278/year-0933/part-07/sources/library/jiuwudaishi-066-song-lingxun/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "e0981de2a798fccbd2822a9c056ba209b0e364dfdf3b712376eb447d1704abb3",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "宋令詢，不知何許人也。閔帝在藩時，補為客將，知書樂善，動皆由禮。長興中，閔帝連典大藩，遷為都押衙，參輔閫政，甚有時譽，閔帝深委之。及閔帝嗣位，朱、馮用事，不欲閔帝之舊臣在於左右，乃出為磁州刺史。"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "0fd8f1a3-64f6-514a-8086-a1aad8ea8031",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/8468a699/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-05/sources/library/xinwudaishi-015-kong-empress/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-05/sources/library/xinwudaishi-015-kong-empress/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "a956b8ee122609261953b68cf6be7dbee706c1ce9ba16bf7234ebd1a07976361",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "愍帝哀皇后孔氏，父循，橫海軍節度使。"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "148ac225-1de0-56c3-bbe7-35e31b36b890",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/d0d4d8bd/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-275/year-0926/part-08/sources/library/xinwudaishi-027-zhuhongzhao/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-275/year-0926/part-08/sources/library/xinwudaishi-027-zhuhongzhao/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "c01495ba44b382f42a862f5e08945b1e91e0908975d06d2ae0700b0419a21e94",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "朱弘昭，太原人也。少事明宗為客將，明宗即位，為文思使。與安重誨有隙，故常使于外。董璋為東川節度使，乃以弘昭為副使。"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "1af97382-7402-5dce-9ad8-4fdd9c9ae220",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/8468a699/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-05/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-accession-aftermath/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-05/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-accession-aftermath/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "e3a21f0a5edb16fbc7da8bf4d588103e4ac7b1a5ad5b8202610eb03734096710",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "遂杀妃，并其四子。"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "1f7eed42-28ae-507c-b759-6555bea18aac",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/8468a699/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-05/sources/library/xinwudaishi-048-conghou-death/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-05/sources/library/xinwudaishi-048-conghou-death/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "a91c8e2330d8c9ac316dd67682917b25e8575b116996108bb9f4ac3cc07d91af",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "弘贄有子巒，為殿直，廢帝入立，遣巒持鴆與弘贄。"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "21d60ff8-2e6c-59bc-9fa3-b56c7f9c17a0",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/8468a699/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-05/sources/library/xinwudaishi-015-kong-empress/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-05/sources/library/xinwudaishi-015-kong-empress/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "a956b8ee122609261953b68cf6be7dbee706c1ce9ba16bf7234ebd1a07976361",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "愍帝出奔，后病子幼，皆不能從。廢帝入立，后及四子皆見殺。"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "2eb1eb57-67bf-5775-b949-fe94842e7495",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/8468a699/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-05/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-accession-aftermath/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-05/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-accession-aftermath/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "e3a21f0a5edb16fbc7da8bf4d588103e4ac7b1a5ad5b8202610eb03734096710",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "弘贽数进酒，闵帝知其有毒，不饮，"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "3341d700-2277-5db9-af8e-d8224f7d3052",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/d4437e45/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-04/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-weizhou/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-04/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-weizhou/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "1a6807f0fc0ff77d0991a7f8321877b9f0d9143c03707508a989b3e9cc6b915e",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "曰：“卫州刺史王弘贽，宿将习事，请与图之。”乃往见弘贽问之，"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "42ef43f1-ca55-5b7b-ac65-122fcbd31b1a",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/8468a699/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-05/sources/library/xinwudaishi-015-kong-empress/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-05/sources/library/xinwudaishi-015-kong-empress/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "a956b8ee122609261953b68cf6be7dbee706c1ce9ba16bf7234ebd1a07976361",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "愍帝哀皇后孔氏，父循，橫海軍節度使。"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "44992053-9dee-5a47-bda3-5b53a14fdc02",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/73f70bd8/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-277/year-0930/part-04/sources/library/tongjian-277-930-autumn-winter/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-277/year-0930/part-04/sources/library/tongjian-277-930-autumn-winter/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "0e19771cd0dfbdf5c3bf1c9a3be27bdf067857a44e5d58b7f805b83727d7ebd8",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "阶州刺史王经贽、泸州刺史冯晖与前锋马步都虞候王思同、步军都指挥使赵在礼引兵出人头山后，过剑门之南，还袭剑门，"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "60ab9807-3d50-536b-ab5b-50dbf705870b",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/8468a699/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-05/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-accession-aftermath/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-05/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-accession-aftermath/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "e3a21f0a5edb16fbc7da8bf4d588103e4ac7b1a5ad5b8202610eb03734096710",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "王弘贽迁闵帝于州廨，"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "60fb02a9-6773-5437-b430-c89cdd0d9c76",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/8468a699/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-05/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-accession-aftermath/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-05/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-accession-aftermath/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "e3a21f0a5edb16fbc7da8bf4d588103e4ac7b1a5ad5b8202610eb03734096710",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "闵帝性仁厚，于兄弟敦睦，虽遭秦王忌疾，闵帝坦怀待之，卒免于患。及嗣位，于潞王亦无嫌，而硃弘昭、孟汉琼之徒横生猜间，闵帝不能违，以致祸败焉。"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "6cee9297-25df-5b1e-a98d-53243b32e845",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/8468a699/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-05/sources/library/xinwudaishi-015-kong-empress/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-05/sources/library/xinwudaishi-015-kong-empress/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "a956b8ee122609261953b68cf6be7dbee706c1ce9ba16bf7234ebd1a07976361",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "愍帝哀皇后孔氏，父循，橫海軍節度使。后有賢行，生四子。愍帝即位，立為皇后，未及冊命而難作。"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "729d8dfb-9a24-5094-b548-cc0da94a7e1e",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/d0d4d8bd/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-275/year-0926/part-08/sources/library/jiuwudaishi-037-926-december-offices/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-275/year-0926/part-08/sources/library/jiuwudaishi-037-926-december-offices/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "9c01b94a4bdc90c1574258901cc21937cc47e8a1169637cc6999f6778600040d",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "庚子，皇第二子金紫光祿大夫、檢校司徒從榮可檢校太保、同平章事、天雄軍節度使、鄴都留守。"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "7e627cde-a336-5d4d-831f-0d3229d869a7",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/8468a699/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-05/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-accession-aftermath/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-05/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-accession-aftermath/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "e3a21f0a5edb16fbc7da8bf4d588103e4ac7b1a5ad5b8202610eb03734096710",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "闵帝性仁厚，于兄弟敦睦，虽遭秦王忌疾，闵帝坦怀待之，卒免于患。及嗣位，于潞王亦无嫌，而硃弘昭、孟汉琼之徒横生猜间，闵帝不能违，以致祸败焉。"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "a766427b-03c6-5e43-afa6-5d169a27c776",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/1ab64add/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-278/year-0933/part-07/sources/library/jiuwudaishi-066-song-lingxun/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-278/year-0933/part-07/sources/library/jiuwudaishi-066-song-lingxun/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "e0981de2a798fccbd2822a9c056ba209b0e364dfdf3b712376eb447d1704abb3",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "閔帝蒙塵於衛，令詢日令人奔問。"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "add97fc2-3964-5e5d-bdca-613f0ded722b",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/8468a699/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-05/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-accession-aftermath/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-05/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-accession-aftermath/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "e3a21f0a5edb16fbc7da8bf4d588103e4ac7b1a5ad5b8202610eb03734096710",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "闻其遇害，恸哭半日，自经死。"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "b0600326-8cab-5295-b018-e6fa3c87f553",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/8468a699/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-05/sources/library/xinwudaishi-048-conghou-death/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-05/sources/library/xinwudaishi-048-conghou-death/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "a91c8e2330d8c9ac316dd67682917b25e8575b116996108bb9f4ac3cc07d91af",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "初，愍帝在衞州，弘贄令市中酒家獻酒，愍帝見之，大驚，遽殞于地，久而蘇，弘贄曰：「此酒家也，願獻酒以慰無憀。」愍帝受之，由是日獻一觴。及巒持酖至，因使酒家獻之，愍帝飲而不疑，遂崩。"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "b865376f-8ecb-532e-ad0f-3324ccd93b9b",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/73f70bd8/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-277/year-0930/part-04/sources/library/tongjian-277-930-rebellion/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-277/year-0930/part-04/sources/library/tongjian-277-930-rebellion/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "bc0d5dd4b13a3d7156929645b167a1229db946d954d58b154748b462e12c7d37",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "王德妃及武德使孟汉琼浸用事，数短重诲于上。"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "d1cf408a-d143-59f3-bf37-4fb25d4d0706",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/8468a699/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-05/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-accession-aftermath/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-05/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-accession-aftermath/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "e3a21f0a5edb16fbc7da8bf4d588103e4ac7b1a5ad5b8202610eb03734096710",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "帝遣弘贽之子殿直峦往鸩之。"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "d7e3315e-31fd-5acb-a9ba-6efe56a9e954",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/d0d4d8bd/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-275/year-0926/part-08/sources/library/tongjian-275-926-yearend-and-927-opening/source.txt",
      "source_path": "content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-275/year-0926/part-08/sources/library/tongjian-275-926-yearend-and-927-opening/source.txt",
      "source_sha256": "2695eeff15568c35112b524c7e83a9ab72930106115aa9f1165b4743cbd7fd37",
      "verbatim_excerpt": "庚子，以皇子从荣为天雄节度使、同平章事。"
    },
    {
      "claim_id": "d823c9f9-b652-5243-a48f-a20e2d08dc66",
      "source_url": "https://github.com/greed-216/histree/blob/8468a699/content/books/zizhi-tongjian/vol-279/year-0934/part-05/sources/library/tongjian-279-934-accession-aftermath/source.txt",
